WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Mohamed is in the computer lab taking a quick bite of his sandwich while working.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Suddenly Mohamed clutches his throat with both hands — the universal choking sign.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Severe silent choking — no sound, no cough, and his lips begin turning blue.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Call emergency services immediately, support Mohamed's chest, and lean him forward.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Alternate up to 5 firm back blows between the shoulder blades with up to 5 abdominal thrusts.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.500
The blockage is expelled and normal breathing returns — reassure him and seek medical follow-up.
